This GrammarBundle incorporates the tree-sitter-rust grammar from:
https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-rust

Pinned upstream release: v0.24.2
Pinned upstream revision: 77a3747266f4d621d0757825e6b11edcbf991ca5
Upstream license: MIT

The generated WASM must be built from the pinned upstream source, including
src/scanner.c. The external scanner is required for raw strings, float literal
lexing, and Rust documentation/block-comment tokenization. The materializer
refuses a source checkout whose revision or required scanner source does not
match the lock contract.
